 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.38,
   "text": "If Claude knows nothing about your plant, why would you trust it?"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.66,
   "end": 5.58,
   "text": "That's why the onboarding skill exists."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.06,
   "end": 9.14,
   "text": "Hi, my name is Sevim, and I am an industrial engineer,"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.38,
   "end": 10.6,
   "text": "AI trainer and consultant."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.12,
   "end": 13.7,
   "text": "In this series, I'm walking through the 17 skills"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.7,
   "end": 16.02,
   "text": "Claude built for factories, one by one."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.38,
   "end": 19.64,
   "text": "To start, open Customize in Claude's left sidebar,"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.76,
   "end": 20.72,
   "text": "then Plugins."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.28,
   "end": 23.72,
   "text": "Find Claude for manufacturing and add it."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.06,
   "end": 25.16,
   "text": "On a company account,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.58,
   "end": 27.96,
   "text": "your admin turns it on in organization settings."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.96,
   "end": 33.2,
   "text": "Then type set us up in a chat Claude asks which ERP, CAD,"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.56,
   "end": 35.0,
   "text": "and maintenance systems you use."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.66,
   "end": 37.58,
   "text": "After that, just describe what you need."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.1,
   "end": 40.74,
   "text": "After install, you say set us up."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.98,
   "end": 42.38,
   "text": "And Claude asks you questions."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.7,
   "end": 45.64,
   "text": "Which ERP, which CAD, which maintenance system,"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.94,
   "end": 48.06,
   "text": "how your shifts run, what your terms mean."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.48,
   "end": 49.8,
   "text": "It tests each connection."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.32,
   "end": 53.76,
   "text": "The result, the other 16 skills work in your plant's language,"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.1,
   "end": 55.6,
   "text": "and you provide that context."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.12,
   "end": 57.04,
   "text": "Claude doesn't guess."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.56,
   "end": 59.0,
   "text": "Would this skill help in your plant?"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.54,
   "end": 61.82,
   "text": "Comment skill for the link and follow for the next one."
  }
 ],
